{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/aa8f38eb047db92958462661bd330e09.avif?t=1763515088\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras_big/aa8f38eb047db92958462661bd330e09.avif?t=1763515088 width=800 height=596 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aksun</strong> is a Hack &amp; Slash Roguelite rooted in Korean shamanic folklore. You are trapped inside the Casket - a cursed sealing device forged to imprison the will of a fallen cult and its monstrous prophet. Every run forces you deeper into a cycle of memory, suffering, and rebirth - but also closer to mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/ef3e484439ba9fdccd6dd95acc058e10.avif?t=1763515088\" width=800 height=380 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESCEND INTO THE SEAL OF AKSUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death in Aksun is merely a part of a ritual and every victory peels back a layer of truth. Trapped inside the Seal of Aksun - a cursed prison born from shattered reincarnation - you\u2019ll awaken lost weapons, absorb corrupted artifacts, and fight your way through a world that remembers your every attempt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THREE-DIMENSINAL BUILD SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aksun\u2019s progression is built on the interaction of three core components:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons</strong>, bound to Hell Gods, define your combat identity and unlock powerful Awakening Skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifacts</strong>, crystallized remnants of cult rituals, grant elemental effects, deployable summons, and active chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes</strong>, synergy-based stat modifiers, tie everything together into unpredictable, layered builds. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/d38e4e0d94f933ba10445c634b1a9061.poster.avif?t=1763515088\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/d38e4e0d94f933ba10445c634b1a9061.webm?t=1763515088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/d38e4e0d94f933ba10445c634b1a9061.mp4?t=1763515088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering the relationships between these three systems is key to surviving - and breaking - the cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/ccb004eecbbd9248b43dd579bc5874e1.poster.avif?t=1763515088\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/ccb004eecbbd9248b43dd579bc5874e1.webm?t=1763515088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ELEMENTS IN CONFLICT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Artifact belongs to one of the Five Elements - Fire, Ice, Wind, Earth, or Lightning - and doesn\u2019t just empower you in isolation. Combine them, and you\u2019ll trigger destructive chain reactions: flame igniting storm, lightning crashing through molten stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/4b9b11c36ddded76ab8ad8e396a6eabd.poster.avif?t=1763515088\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/4b9b11c36ddded76ab8ad8e396a6eabd.webm?t=1763515088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/4b9b11c36ddded76ab8ad8e396a6eabd.mp4?t=1763515088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEW RUN, NEW BUILD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter is a branching node map. After each stage, choose your next path and reward: strengthen your weapon with Resonance, gain a new Artifact Chime, unlock awakened passives, collect Echoes to shape your stats, or shop for high-risk upgrades. Every death resets your loadout, but each run teaches you more - unlocking smarter, deadlier combinations that evolve your build in unpredictable ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/64b19a619157adf63f7aab713eda9789.avif?t=1763515088\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LORE THAT BLEEDS INTO PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire game takes place inside a distorted echo of the Six Realms of Rebirth - a closed loop designed to punish those who rejected the cycle. The Mokdugi King, once a cult leader, is now its most broken prisoner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every design - from its mechanics to its symbols - is rooted in Korean myths, rituals, and spiritual beliefs: shamanism, elemental balance, divine punishment, and ancestral memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn\u2019t just myth. It\u2019s ritual, played in blood.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/ea94cf50b1b3ee68074a26faf8f049bc.avif?t=1763515088\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3129360?t=1763515088","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/cb9dc2fc27ba259eca1dc9153d92ea42c97f1ef8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763515088","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/771c85b374a146aa89bb4feaaa6705d141f9a798/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763515088","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/771c85b374a146aa89bb4feaaa6705d141f9a798/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763515088","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains mature content suitable for players aged 15 and over, including intense violence, mild depictions of self-harm, psychological themes, indirect sexual references, and sensitive topics like social inequality and religious sacrifices. Consider these aspects before playing."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3480450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/aa8f38eb047db92958462661bd330e09.avif?t=1763515088\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras_big/aa8f38eb047db92958462661bd330e09.avif?t=1763515088 width=800 height=596 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aksun</strong> is a Hack &amp; Slash Roguelite rooted in Korean shamanic folklore. You are trapped inside the Casket - a cursed sealing device forged to imprison the will of a fallen cult and its monstrous prophet. Every run forces you deeper into a cycle of memory, suffering, and rebirth - but also closer to mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/ef3e484439ba9fdccd6dd95acc058e10.avif?t=1763515088\" width=800 height=380 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESCEND INTO THE SEAL OF AKSUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death in Aksun is merely a part of a ritual and every victory peels back a layer of truth. Trapped inside the Seal of Aksun - a cursed prison born from shattered reincarnation - you\u2019ll awaken lost weapons, absorb corrupted artifacts, and fight your way through a world that remembers your every attempt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THREE-DIMENSINAL BUILD SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aksun\u2019s progression is built on the interaction of three core components:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons</strong>, bound to Hell Gods, define your combat identity and unlock powerful Awakening Skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifacts</strong>, crystallized remnants of cult rituals, grant elemental effects, deployable summons, and active chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes</strong>, synergy-based stat modifiers, tie everything together into unpredictable, layered builds. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/d38e4e0d94f933ba10445c634b1a9061.poster.avif?t=1763515088\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/d38e4e0d94f933ba10445c634b1a9061.webm?t=1763515088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/d38e4e0d94f933ba10445c634b1a9061.mp4?t=1763515088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering the relationships between these three systems is key to surviving - and breaking - the cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/ccb004eecbbd9248b43dd579bc5874e1.poster.avif?t=1763515088\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/ccb004eecbbd9248b43dd579bc5874e1.webm?t=1763515088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ELEMENTS IN CONFLICT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Artifact belongs to one of the Five Elements - Fire, Ice, Wind, Earth, or Lightning - and doesn\u2019t just empower you in isolation. Combine them, and you\u2019ll trigger destructive chain reactions: flame igniting storm, lightning crashing through molten stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/4b9b11c36ddded76ab8ad8e396a6eabd.poster.avif?t=1763515088\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/4b9b11c36ddded76ab8ad8e396a6eabd.webm?t=1763515088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/4b9b11c36ddded76ab8ad8e396a6eabd.mp4?t=1763515088\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEW RUN, NEW BUILD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter is a branching node map. After each stage, choose your next path and reward: strengthen your weapon with Resonance, gain a new Artifact Chime, unlock awakened passives, collect Echoes to shape your stats, or shop for high-risk upgrades. Every death resets your loadout, but each run teaches you more - unlocking smarter, deadlier combinations that evolve your build in unpredictable ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/64b19a619157adf63f7aab713eda9789.avif?t=1763515088\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LORE THAT BLEEDS INTO PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire game takes place inside a distorted echo of the Six Realms of Rebirth - a closed loop designed to punish those who rejected the cycle. The Mokdugi King, once a cult leader, is now its most broken prisoner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every design - from its mechanics to its symbols - is rooted in Korean myths, rituals, and spiritual beliefs: shamanism, elemental balance, divine punishment, and ancestral memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn\u2019t just myth. It\u2019s ritual, played in blood.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/ea94cf50b1b3ee68074a26faf8f049bc.avif?t=1763515088\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p>","developers":["Wayway Inc"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/ececc3959e72fd7ed7a66f8bd5a74131bfa9c970/header.jpg?t=1763515088","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3129360/1850576297/a4a8c9d5575f12c94d9269dbcaafbf00ed9d37ef/1754664728/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754665530","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3129360/1850576297/a4a8c9d5575f12c94d9269dbcaafbf00ed9d37ef/1754664728/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754665530","highlight":true,